<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="maestro-report-contract" content="{{contract}}">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>{{title}} - {{date}}</title>
<style>
{{theme_css}}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="header"><div class="header-inner">
  {{brand_logo}}
  <!-- Default logo when the marker is left empty: Maestro lockup. An overlay fills the marker and deletes the default block below. -->
  <svg viewBox="0 0 232 48" style="height:32px" role="img" aria-label="Maestro logo"><rect x="2" y="8" width="32" height="32" rx="9" fill="#0a84ff"/><path d="M2 11 L5 4 L8 9 L11 4 L14 11" transform="translate(2 8) scale(2)" stroke="#ffffff" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" fill="none"/><text x="42" y="32" font-family="Inter, system-ui, sans-serif" font-weight="700" font-size="24" letter-spacing="-0.5" fill="#ffffff">Maestro</text></svg>
  <h1 data-report-title>{{title}}</h1>
  <div class="meta">
    <div>Date: <b>{{date}}</b> · Govard <code>{{govard_version}}</code> · <code>{{host}}</code> · profile <code>{{profile}}</code></div>
    <div>Magento <code>{{magento_version}}</code> · PHP <code>{{php_version}}</code> · MariaDB <code>{{mariadb_version}}</code> · Redis <code>{{redis_version}}</code> · OpenSearch <code>{{opensearch_version}}</code> · {{fpc}}</div>
  </div>
</div></div>
<div class="container">

<div class="kpi">
  <div class="box"><div class="label">Infra</div><div class="value">{{infra_verdict}}</div><div class="sub">{{infra_sub}}</div></div>
  <div class="box"><div class="label">Cache</div><div class="value">{{cache_verdict}}</div><div class="sub">{{cache_sub}}</div></div>
  <div class="box"><div class="label">Indexer</div><div class="value">{{indexer_verdict}}</div><div class="sub">{{indexer_sub}}</div></div>
  <div class="box"><div class="label">Cron</div><div class="value">{{cron_verdict}}</div><div class="sub">{{cron_sub}}</div></div>
</div>

<div class="card">
  <h2>Verdict</h2>
  <p class="verdict" data-report-verdict>{{verdict}}</p>
</div>

<div class="card">
  <h2>URLs Audited <span class="badge badge-gray">{{scope}} · {{page_count}} pages · double-pass</span></h2>
  <table>
    <tr><th>Type</th><th>URL</th><th>Queries</th></tr>
    {{urls_rows}}
  </table>
</div>

<div class="card">
  <h2>Before/After Comparison Matrix <span class="badge badge-gray">same metrics · frozen URL set</span></h2>
  {{matrix}}
  <div style="font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px">One row per page; each cell reads before → after. Uncached server render (queries, profiler root, TTFB) is captured with full_page, block_html and layout caches disabled, so backend work shows here. Warm CWV is the median of 3 Lighthouse runs served from the full page cache, each run proving its own HIT. Closed fixed column set: columns change only through a template update, never per report. A metric recorded on one side only is a gate failure, not a blank cell; a side that cannot be measured carries its closed Skipped reason.</div>
</div>

<div class="card">
  <h2>Infrastructure <span class="badge {{infra_badge}}">{{infra_status}}</span></h2>
  {{infra_checks}}
</div>

<div class="card">
  <h2>Cache Status <span class="badge {{cache_badge}}">{{cache_status}}</span></h2>
  {{cache_checks}}
</div>

<div class="card">
  <h2>Cache Invalidation Efficiency <span class="badge {{cache_inv_badge}}">{{cache_inv_status}}</span></h2>
  {{cache_inv_checks}}
</div>

<div class="card">
  <h2>Client-Side AJAX Load <span class="badge {{ajax_badge}}">{{ajax_status}}</span></h2>
  {{ajax_checks}}
</div>

<div class="card">
  <h2>Indexer Configuration</h2>
  {{indexer_checks}}
</div>

<div class="card">
  <h2>Database</h2>
  <table>
    <tr><th>Page</th><th>Queries</th><th>TIME max</th><th>TIME avg</th><th>≥1s</th><th>≥0.05s</th><th>≥0.01s</th></tr>
    {{db_rows}}
  </table>
  <ul>
    {{db_bullets}}
  </ul>
</div>

<div class="card">
  <h2>Per-Page Query Detail <span class="badge {{perpage_badge}}">{{perpage_status}}</span></h2>
  {{perpage_details}}
  <div style="font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px">Deep: 7 pages unfiltered per-page tables (mandatory). Quick: Skipped matrix entry only. Each <code>&lt;details&gt;</code> shows total queries + distinct-shape count; tables are <code>Count | SQL (normalized)</code>.</div>
</div>

<div class="card">
  <h2>Top Repeated Query Shapes</h2>
  <table>
    <tr><th>Shape (normalized)</th><th>Count</th><th>Pages</th><th>Avg ms</th><th>Max ms</th><th>Evidence</th></tr>
    {{repeated_rows}}
  </table>
</div>

<div class="card">
  <h2>Core Web Vitals <span class="badge {{cwv_badge}}">{{cwv_status}}</span></h2>
  <table>
    <tr><th>Page</th><th>Score</th><th>LCP</th><th>CLS</th><th>TTFB (warm)</th><th>Spread</th><th>HIT proof</th></tr>
    {{cwv_rows}}
  </table>
  <div style="font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px">Warm only: each page is primed, then measured 3 times (deep) from the full page cache with <code>--throttling-method=devtools</code>; the table shows the median and the spread (max minus min). Every run proves its HIT from the document response headers in its own devtools log.</div>
</div>

<div class="card" style="border-left:4px solid var(--red)">
  <h2>Recommendations <span class="badge badge-red">{{rec_count}} actions</span></h2>
  <ol style="margin:8px 0;padding-left:18px;font-size:13px">{{recommendations}}</ol>
</div>

<div class="card">
  <h2>Coverage Note <span class="badge badge-green">Self-verified</span></h2>
  <div style="font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)">{{coverage_note}}</div>
</div>

<div class="footer">Generated {{date}} from live govard captures on <code>{{host}}</code>. <a href="report.md">Markdown</a> · <a href="report.pdf">PDF via Print</a></div>

</div>
</body>
</html>
